 34AR4c  detected with the focal-plane detector system. Measured |s(|q), |q=0|',
 34AR5c  8|', 11|'. Deduced levels. Comparisons with available data. Calculated 
 34AR6c  astrophysical {+30}S(|a,p){+33}Cl reaction rate.                       
